1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,100
The stairs are pitch black. Your
flashlight shows two hundred steps,
all the same.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:10,267
Then your foot finds it. A thin green
line, glowing on the floor, as if it
were alive.

3
00:00:10,767 --> 00:00:16,467
Rule seven. Follow the glowing strip
on the floor. Smoke rises, and the
strip stays low.

4
00:00:16,967 --> 00:00:22,800
Every ship has them. They soak up
light all day, and give it back all
night. Your way out, even blind.
